<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>SweepLine</title>
<script src="/assets/theme.js"></script>
<link href="https://unpkg.com/maplibre-gl@5.6.1/dist/maplibre-gl.css" rel="stylesheet"><link href="/assets/app.css" rel="stylesheet">
<script defer src="https://unpkg.com/maplibre-gl@5.6.1/dist/maplibre-gl.js"></script><script defer src="/assets/account.js"></script><script defer src="/assets/app.js"></script></head>
<body><header><a class="brand" href="/">&#8605; <span>SweepLine <small>ROAD DISCOVERY</small></span></a><span class="region" id="coverage">LOCAL ROADS. OPEN POSSIBILITIES.</span><label class="theme-picker" for="theme">Theme<select id="theme" name="theme"><option value="adaptive" selected>Adaptive</option><option value="light">Light</option><option value="dark">Dark</option></select></label><div class="account-actions"><span id="account-name"></span><button id="admin-open" type="button" hidden>Manage</button><button id="sign-out" type="button" hidden>Sign out</button></div></header>
<section id="account-gate" class="account-gate">
<div class="account-card"><span class="eyebrow">WELCOME TO SWEEPLINE</span><h1 id="account-title">Sign in</h1><p id="account-intro">Loading your session…</p>
<form id="account-form" hidden><label>Username<input name="username" autocomplete="username" placeholder="superadmin" required maxlength="254"></label><label>Password<input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required maxlength="72"></label><button type="submit" id="account-submit">Sign in</button></form><p id="account-status" role="status"></p><button type="button" id="account-retry" hidden>Retry connection</button></div></section>
<section id="admin-panel" class="admin-panel" hidden aria-label="SuperAdmin management">
<div class="admin-heading"><h2>SuperAdmin management</h2><button id="admin-close" type="button">Close</button></div><p>Manage web accounts and automatic data preparation. Linux service accounts are separate.</p>
<div class="admin-columns"><div><h3>Users</h3><form id="create-user"><label>Username<input name="username" required minlength="3" maxlength="64" pattern="[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_.-]{2,63}" autocomplete="off"></label><label>Name<input name="name" required maxlength="100"></label><label>Email (optional)<input name="email" type="email" maxlength="254"></label><label>Initial password<input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="12" maxlength="72" required></label><button type="submit">Create user</button></form><div id="user-list"></div></div>
<div><h3>Data preparation</h3><p id="worker-status"></p><button id="admin-refresh" type="button">Refresh status</button><div id="task-list"></div></div></div><p id="admin-status" role="status"></p></section>
<main id="workspace" hidden><aside><div class="intro"><span class="eyebrow">TAKE THE INTERESTING WAY</span><h1>Find your next<br>favorite road.</h1><p>Discover the curves, open stretches, and roads worth driving.</p></div>
<form id="search"><div class="pair"><label>US ZIP code<input name="zip" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{5}" maxlength="5" placeholder="5-digit ZIP" required autocomplete="postal-code"></label><label>Radius<select name="radius"><option>25</option><option selected>50</option><option>75</option><option>100</option><option>150</option><option value="custom">Custom</option></select><span class="unit">miles</span></label></div>
<label id="custom-wrap" hidden>Custom radius (1&ndash;150 miles)<input name="custom_radius" type="number" min="1" max="150" value="50"></label>
<label>YOUR DRIVING PROFILE<select name="profile" id="profile"><option value="twisty">Twisty Roads &middot; curves &amp; continuity</option><option value="open">Open Highways &middot; long &amp; uninterrupted</option></select></label>
<label for="min-length">Road longer than (miles) <span class="optional">Optional</span><input id="min-length" name="min_length" type="number" min="0" max="30" step="any" placeholder="No minimum" aria-describedby="length-help"></label><label for="max-length">Maximum road length (miles) <span class="optional">Optional</span><input id="max-length" name="max_length" type="number" min="0" max="150" step="any" placeholder="No maximum" aria-describedby="length-help"></label><p id="length-help" class="field-help">Leave either bound blank for no limit. Applies to the full continuous road stretch; the maximum is inclusive.</p>
<details><summary>Advanced filters</summary><label>Maximum mapped stops + uncertain controls<input name="max_stops" type="number" value="5" min="0" max="100"></label><label class="check"><input name="paved" type="checkbox" checked> Known paved roads only</label></details>
<button type="submit" id="submit">Discover roads <span>&#8599;</span></button></form>
<div class="results-heading"><h2>Your discoveries</h2><span id="count">&mdash;</span></div><p role="status" id="status">Choose a ZIP code to explore imported roads nearby.</p><div id="results"></div>
<footer>Road characteristics for lawful driving. Mapped controls may be incomplete. Check access, closures, and conditions.<br>Road data &copy; <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright">OpenStreetMap contributors</a> &middot; ZIP data <a href="https://www.geonames.org/">GeoNames</a></footer></aside>
<section class="map-wrap" aria-label="Road discovery map"><div id="map"></div><div class="map-tag">EXPLORE SOMETHING DIFFERENT <span>&#8599;</span></div><div class="legend"><span class="dot"></span>Road score <b>0</b><i></i><b>100</b></div><div id="road-detail" hidden></div></section></main></body></html>